{
  "_comment": "Rename this file to local_settings.json and fill in your values.",
  "_comment2": "Only include keys you want to override — omit the rest to keep Cade's defaults.",
  "_comment3": "DO NOT send local_settings.json to Cade. Keep it only on your test machine.",

